<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Years to fix Australia c/a deficit - Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Years to fix Australia c/a deficit - Costello.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday Australia's current account deficit problem would take a number of years to fix.</p>
<p>&quot;This problem will take numbers of years to fix and in relation to our current account deficit, it's the question of savings that must be addressed,&quot; Costello told parliament.</p>
</text>
